# Jobs API (Pat92) — workplace filter default

- **`JOBS_API_WORKPLACE_TYPES`** defaults to **`remote`** when unset (see `workplaceTypesParam` in `src/providers/jobsApi.ts`). This matches the app’s **remote-first** job search; operators override only when they intentionally want hybrid/onsite in the vendor query.
- **`mergeJobsApiPat92`** sets **`isRemote: true`** on normalized rows because the pipeline only ingests remote-filtered listings for this source; if the search filter is widened later, revisit normalization so dashboard and filters stay consistent.
